<section class="section surface">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <span class="kicker">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="h1" style="margin: 20px 0 16px;">Privacy policy.</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: <%= Date.today.strftime('%B %Y') %></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sm surface-alt rule-top rule-bottom">
  <div class="wrap-narrow legal-prose">

    <h2 class="h2">1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>Consilix Ltd (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;, or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use and disclose information when you interact with <strong>consilix.ai</strong> or engage us commercially.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">2. Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact details</strong> you submit via the contact form or by email (name, email address, company, message).</li>
      <li><strong>Engagement information</strong> shared during an audit, build, or retainer &mdash; limited to what is necessary to deliver the work.</li>
      <li><strong>Website usage data</strong>: standard server logs (IP address, browser type, page requested, referrer) retained for a short window for operational and security purposes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h2">3. How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to enquiries and schedule calls.</li>
      <li>To deliver the engagement you have commissioned.</li>
      <li>To keep our systems secure and detect abuse.</li>
      <li>To meet our legal and tax obligations in the UK.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your information. We do not run marketing automation against visitors who submit the contact form.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">4. Sharing of information</h2>
    <p>Information is shared only with sub-processors we rely on to operate &mdash; our email provider, the calendar service used for bookings and standard infrastructure (hosting, backup, DNS). A full list is available on request.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">5. Security</h2>
    <p>We apply appropriate technical and organisational measures &mdash; encrypted transport, access-restricted storage, least-privilege credentials. No internet service is 100% secure, but we aim for a standard commensurate with the sensitivity of the data we hold.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">6. Data retention</h2>
    <p>Contact-form submissions are kept for as long as the conversation is active and for a reasonable follow-up window after. Engagement records are retained in line with UK tax and accounting requirements.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under UK GDPR you have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict the use of your personal data and to object to certain processing. To exercise any of these, email <a class="link-text" href="mailto:hello@consilix.ai">hello@consilix.ai</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">8. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a class="link-text" href="mailto:hello@consilix.ai">hello@consilix.ai</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .legal-prose h2 { margin: 40px 0 14px; }
  .legal-prose h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal-prose p { max-width: 64ch; margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .legal-prose ul { margin: 0 0 16px 1.2em; padding: 0; }
  .legal-prose li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 8px; max-width: 64ch; }
  .legal-prose strong { color: var(--ink); }
</style>
